  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018740,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the nature of the platform?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019790,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think Twitter will always be closer"
