  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5642144,
    "dDurationMs": 3103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how do you suggest\nothers define success"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5645247,
    "dDurationMs": 2013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on YouTube?\n- It's so subjective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5647260,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some people, success is\nretiring their mom, literally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5651850,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For you, success is inspiring people,"
