  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7935930,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they can push back.\n- Yeah, you can see it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7937730,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like Tyler, anytime I said something,"
